Design: Add to rt_ops.rs:
- `It::GenOnce(Box<dyn FnMut() -> Result<Option<V>, E>>, bool)` (or `GenExp`).
- In `It::next_slow` match:
```
It::GenExp(f, done) => {
    if *done { return Ok(None); }
    match f() {
        Ok(v) => Ok(v),
        Err(e) => { *done = true; Err(e) }
    }
}
```
